solution.p:
Substitute -2 in for the variable C and simplify:
\begin{aligned}
\amp{9\mathopen{}\left(-2\right)^{2}+7\cdot \left(-2\right)-6}\\
\amp={9\cdot 4+7\cdot \left(-2\right)-6}\\
\amp={36+\left(-14\right)-6}\\
\amp={16}
\end{aligned}

